    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you the augmentation force in striking Heart Hunter base? I think we met before.",
      "translation" : "你是來襲擊心臟獵人基地的增援部隊嗎？我覺得我們以前見過。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just a thought.",
      "translation" : "只是有這種感覺。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it doesn't matter. You should have a rough idea of what's going on here. Just remember that it's not going to be an easy task.",
      "translation" : "算了，這不重要。你應該大致瞭解這裡的情況。記住，這次任務絕不輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Explain the situation to me.",
      "translation" : "給我說明一下情況。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No time, let's proceed now.",
      "translation" : "沒時間了，我們現在就出發。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sounds cool. You are like a foreign legion, so stay beside me during the operation.",
      "translation" : "聽起來不錯。你就像一支外籍軍團，行動時跟緊我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm, you haven't received a briefing yet? Since we don't have enough time, let me explain briefly.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你還沒收到簡報嗎？時間不多了，我簡單說明一下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We don't have enough forces to strike the base.",
      "translation" : "我們沒有足夠兵力攻打基地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For the sake of mobility, we abandoned heavy firearms. Since our top priority mission is to occupy the base without destroying it much, most of explosive weapons have been excluded as well.",
      "translation" : "為了提高機動性，我們放棄了重型槍械。首要任務是在不大肆破壞基地的情況下將其佔領，因此也排除了大多數爆炸性武器。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If necessary, we can reinforce our firearms using the terrain features in the field... But it must be minimized.",
      "translation" : "必要時，我們可以利用現場地形增強槍械威力...不過必須儘量減少破壞。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In any case, most of the operation must be anti-personnel damage and the base facilities have to be maintained whenever possible.",
      "translation" : "總之，行動中主要針對敵方人員造成傷害，並儘可能保留基地設施。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Our advance party has secured the boundary surface in the southern base. We will take that route to move to the central part. And each striker unit will move in an individual route.",
      "translation" : "先遣隊已經控制了基地南側的外圍區域。我們會沿那條路線前往中央區域，各突擊小隊則分別沿不同路線行動。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are like a foreign legion, so stay beside me during the operation. Any more question? Of course, I won't take any, even though you have one.",
      "translation" : "你就像一支外籍軍團，行動時跟緊我。還有問題嗎？當然，就算你有問題，我也沒時間回答。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After that, follow the instruction of the chief of your unit. Once the gate to the base is opened, talk to the Striker Unit Commander over there and start.",
      "translation" : "之後聽從小隊長的指示。基地大門開啟後，和那邊的突擊小隊指揮官交談，然後開始行動。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you are ready, I will let you know the attack time.",
      "translation" : "準備好後告訴我，我會通知你進攻時間。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm ready.",
      "translation" : "我準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I need some more time.",
      "translation" : "我還需要一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I see. Since we are in a hurry, complete your preparation quickly and let me know.",
      "translation" : "知道了。時間緊迫，儘快準備好再告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After that, follow the instruction of the chief of your unit. Once the gate to the base is opened, talk to the Striker Unit Commander over there and start.",
      "translation" : "之後聽從小隊長的指示。基地大門開啟後，和那邊的突擊小隊指揮官交談，然後開始行動。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
